<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>PayRun</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f3f4f6;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        h2 {
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        ul {
            margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem 0;
            padding-left: 1.2rem;
        }

        ul li {
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        table, th, td {
            border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
        }

        tr:last-child {
            font-weight: bold;
            background-color: #f3f4f6;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Hola {{driverName}}</h2>

        <p>Este es el detalle de tu <strong>PayRun</strong>:</p>

        <ul>
            <li><strong>Pay Period:</strong> {{payPeriod}}</li>
            <li><strong>Calculated At:</strong> {{calculatedAt}}</li>
            <li><strong>Gross:</strong> {{gross}}</li>
            <li><strong>Status:</strong> {{status}}</li>

        </ul>

        {{tablaPayRun}}

        <div class="footer">
            — TTO Logistics
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
